      "text": "A method is a function that is part of a class.",
      "basis": "explicit",
      "availability": "SOURCE_SUPPORTED",
      "literal_kind": "verbal",
      "instructional_role": null,
      "refs": ["Q0001"],
      "related_refs": []
    },
    {
      "id": "C2",
      "text": "A function that exists outside a class is called a function.",
