      "availability": "SOURCE_SUPPORTED",
      "literal_kind": "verbal",
      "instructional_role": null,
      "refs": ["Q0003", "Q0004"],
      "related_refs": []
    },
    {
      "id": "C3",
      "text": "An access modifier is a special keyword that determines if other classes and methods can access these classes and methods.",
